                "Acetaldehyde kettle R-7 in the AS-2 digital twin at Aldehyd-Stank carries copper liquor "
                "0.62 mass fraction, 0.16 below the 0.78 nuclear-density interlock, and a 72 C catalyst "
                "pocket 20 C shy of the 92 C metal limit. The 5.6 t/h ethylene already admitted therefore "
                "stays on the legal side of every published trip.",